'''Greatswords''' (大剣両断, ''Taiken Ryōdan'', '''Cut in Two''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (M): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 50%.

